{"5091010":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Abandon All Hope","steam_appid":5091010,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/3f7e40ba5b1d4ec0f5daba82b7fa2d1b.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandon All Hope is a dark fantasy action RPG for 1 to 4 players. It is about fighting tooth and nail across a connected world of thirteen regions, hunting down the Seven Sins, crafting absurdly powerful gear, and digging into a world that's literally breaking apart under your boots.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/bf44fda32932421f2c7e80e37a6c3192.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/bf44fda32932421f2c7e80e37a6c3192.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/bf44fda32932421f2c7e80e37a6c3192.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A CAMPAIGN ACTUALLY WORTH FINISHING<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aldren Veyr, the Grave Regent, isn't just mindlessly burning villages. She has commandeered an army of raised dead and conscripted cults to steal bodies, runes, and ancient warding relics from every culture he paves over. It looks like a standard world conquest, but he is actually building something.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A focused 3 to 6 hour main story spanning 57 multi-stage quests across 13  regions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Rebuild The Last Gate from a ruined outpost into a thriving hub. Rescue the healer, free the confessor, hire a runewright, and unlock new services as you build out your crew.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/8402de81480f981dc62345a81beabddb.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONNECTED WORLDS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from pirate coves and goblin war camps to samurai shrines, frozen fjords, and elven ruins, all the way to the Bastion of Lost Hope.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore 13 regions, facing 100+ unique monsters. Every area has its own distinct local threats.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hunt roaming World Champions for a serious challenge and top-tier drops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hidden treasure caches randomize their locations every time a map loads to keep exploration fresh.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlock permanent shortcuts back to The Last Gate as you push further into the unknown.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Already beat the campaign? Roll a new alt in Adventure Mode with every route and hub service unlocked right from level one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/747ae7e8d593cbdcb6f92e965f98585c.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/747ae7e8d593cbdcb6f92e965f98585c.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/747ae7e8d593cbdcb6f92e965f98585c.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/306ad774dd6dbc9c89125798c98a75a0.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOUR CLASSES, ENDLESS WAYS TO PLAY<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Brawler<\/strong>: Generate Rage with every hit and dump it all into massive Leaps, Berserk states, and brutal Bloodshed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Spellbinder<\/strong>: Manage your Mana pool to blink across the battlefield, absorb hits, and rain down Meteor Showers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Nightstalker<\/strong>: A high-Energy assassin that vanishes into the shadows, snares targets, and bursts them down.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Priest<\/strong>: Generate Holy Power by keeping your team alive, then spend it to shield, heal, and smite.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your class is just the foundation; your weapons define your build. With 13 weapon types and over 150 skills, your abilities physically change depending on what's in your hands. An off-hand sword grants a parry or riposte, a mace brings the stuns, and a shield lets you charge. Every weapon type has its own level 20 mastery track, meaning experimenting with new gear never feels like wasted time. Plus, the right gear can push your skills well past their normal level caps.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/c591f00c9cea65bfb6898b46834ac5c8.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/c591f00c9cea65bfb6898b46834ac5c8.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/c591f00c9cea65bfb6898b46834ac5c8.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/74d2e0266a96897f2552edf521ac247f.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBAT YOU HAVE TO READ, NOT SPAM<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stamina matters. Manage your dodging and sprinting or get caught out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Enemies telegraph attacks with a clear glint, and if you interrupt their swing, it doesn't land.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Break an enemy's guard to stagger them and open them up for massive damage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Builder\/spender economy: Earn your power before you blow it. Fully empowered heavy attacks devastate; swinging wild with no resources just glances off.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bosses have multiple phases and highly readable mechanics. Miss a ritual interrupt, and you just buffed the boss. Every mechanic matters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/5c456b8c5b47a1f9b0fc767265fd7b86.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/5c456b8c5b47a1f9b0fc767265fd7b86.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/5c456b8c5b47a1f9b0fc767265fd7b86.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Actual Gameplay footage, except for 'Cinematic' Camera angles)<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/699f29188a876bbe6634b39bdbef77db.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOOT THAT KEEPS YOU UP TOO LATE<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Six rarity tiers from Common to Mythic, complete with the mandatory, dopamine-inducing light beams when they drop. • Loot physically scatters and tumbles across the ground. Chests don't just open; they violently erupt with treasure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Upgrade weapons all the way to +20. They gain glowing visual effects every five levels: Frostbound, Radiant, Inferno, and Transcendent.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Slot runes, cut sockets, and reroll that one annoying affix you absolutely hate.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Diablo-style quick salvage so you can instantly turn junk inventory into upgrade mats.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Equip Sin Relics, condensed fragments of boss power that can completely alter how your build plays.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/d8d7f47369cbb927eb28953ee695a311.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/d8d7f47369cbb927eb28953ee695a311.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/d8d7f47369cbb927eb28953ee695a311.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRAFTING THAT ACTUALLY MATTERS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Master Blacksmithing, Tailoring, Refining, Cooking, and Potion Making.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Gather materials via Mining, Woodcutting, and Foraging (complete with a timing mini-game so you can harvest faster).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Build gear from scratch. The materials you choose dictate the stats, rarity, and appearance, and you get to preview the exact result before you spend a dime.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cook 16 different meals from up to four ingredients to stack long-lasting buffs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Experiment to find hidden properties in reagents and brew potions for healing, speed, warding, and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/1aac47f5bc70c5beedbf063ec92dcc79.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE ENDGAME: THE DESCENT<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Expeditions<\/strong>: Dive into procedurally generated dungeons across six districts. Pick a Dominion (Ashen Reach, Black Fortress, or Hollow Wilds), and fight your way to a Warden boss.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Covenant Trials:<\/strong> Co-op shrine runs mixing puzzles and combat. You will get three random puzzles (out of 15) leading up to a guardian fight. Entirely doable solo, but way more fun with a squad.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>The Last Vigil:<\/strong> A horde mode where you hold a fortress against six escalating, three-lane assaults. Bank your loot between waves, or push your luck for better rewards and risk losing it all.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/429358bc76dd4113a64af0a4d955961c.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/429358bc76dd4113a64af0a4d955961c.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/429358bc76dd4113a64af0a4d955961c.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/9f75976427ad5fabd3bea5f772437634.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BETTER TOGETHER<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Seamless drop-in and drop-out online co-op for 1 to 4 players via Steam.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Friends can jump in mid-run, and everyone gets their own instanced loot. No fighting over drops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Every boss, puzzle, and defense event scales beautifully. Solo is completely viable, but in a party, everyone has a real role to play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/9bf3a2fcb8f8617610ed33b59ae919bc.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/9bf3a2fcb8f8617610ed33b59ae919bc.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/9bf3a2fcb8f8617610ed33b59ae919bc.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/9285caa1af2bc887774334edd124ca95.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROFESSIONS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Gather Ores, flowers, and wood from around the world.<i> Mining makes you stronger (<\/i>+STR),<i> Gathering makes you smarter (<\/i>+INT).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Craft potions that give you meaningful buffs<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cook food that will make you stronger<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Forge your perfect Sword, or Chest Piece by using materials that provide the stats you need.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/1bd7520e9311b68fc7f33c0e259066c4.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/1bd7520e9311b68fc7f33c0e259066c4.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/1bd7520e9311b68fc7f33c0e259066c4.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAKE IT YOURS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Craft Armor, and Weapons Exactly the way you want them to be.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A deep, modular character creator to dial in your exact look.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A fully-featured Wardrobe system: once you loot a piece of gear, you unlock its look permanently.. Transmog away.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 47 dye palettes to color-coordinate your armor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Five character slots, a shared account stash, and Steam Cloud saves to keep your progress safe.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/3f4b7c62602f93163aeeb38ccb5d5254.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/3f4b7c62602f93163aeeb38ccb5d5254.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/3f4b7c62602f93163aeeb38ccb5d5254.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/52e4a2b54dfdad0dd78f96121f756f3c.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Seven Sins are only the mouths. Something beneath the world has finally opened its eye.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Sin Hunts:<\/strong> Track down the Seven Sins and the Grave Regent as repeatable, super-charged bosses to farm their unique relics. (Mythics)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Push your limits with four difficulties (up to Abyssal) and toggleable Oaths that crank up both the danger and the drop rates.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Sera's Ledger:<\/strong> A bounty board of wanted posters and contracts rewarding you for clearing every activity on every difficulty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/988f21bff7b6fe0836be829a6f96b7b1.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/988f21bff7b6fe0836be829a6f96b7b1.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/988f21bff7b6fe0836be829a6f96b7b1.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Abandon all hope.&quot;<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/3f7e40ba5b1d4ec0f5daba82b7fa2d1b.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandon All Hope is a dark fantasy action RPG for 1 to 4 players. It is about fighting tooth and nail across a connected world of thirteen regions, hunting down the Seven Sins, crafting absurdly powerful gear, and digging into a world that's literally breaking apart under your boots.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/bf44fda32932421f2c7e80e37a6c3192.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/bf44fda32932421f2c7e80e37a6c3192.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/bf44fda32932421f2c7e80e37a6c3192.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A CAMPAIGN ACTUALLY WORTH FINISHING<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aldren Veyr, the Grave Regent, isn't just mindlessly burning villages. She has commandeered an army of raised dead and conscripted cults to steal bodies, runes, and ancient warding relics from every culture he paves over. It looks like a standard world conquest, but he is actually building something.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A focused 3 to 6 hour main story spanning 57 multi-stage quests across 13  regions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Rebuild The Last Gate from a ruined outpost into a thriving hub. Rescue the healer, free the confessor, hire a runewright, and unlock new services as you build out your crew.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/8402de81480f981dc62345a81beabddb.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONNECTED WORLDS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from pirate coves and goblin war camps to samurai shrines, frozen fjords, and elven ruins, all the way to the Bastion of Lost Hope.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore 13 regions, facing 100+ unique monsters. Every area has its own distinct local threats.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hunt roaming World Champions for a serious challenge and top-tier drops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hidden treasure caches randomize their locations every time a map loads to keep exploration fresh.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlock permanent shortcuts back to The Last Gate as you push further into the unknown.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Already beat the campaign? Roll a new alt in Adventure Mode with every route and hub service unlocked right from level one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/747ae7e8d593cbdcb6f92e965f98585c.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/747ae7e8d593cbdcb6f92e965f98585c.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/747ae7e8d593cbdcb6f92e965f98585c.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/306ad774dd6dbc9c89125798c98a75a0.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOUR CLASSES, ENDLESS WAYS TO PLAY<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Brawler<\/strong>: Generate Rage with every hit and dump it all into massive Leaps, Berserk states, and brutal Bloodshed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Spellbinder<\/strong>: Manage your Mana pool to blink across the battlefield, absorb hits, and rain down Meteor Showers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Nightstalker<\/strong>: A high-Energy assassin that vanishes into the shadows, snares targets, and bursts them down.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Priest<\/strong>: Generate Holy Power by keeping your team alive, then spend it to shield, heal, and smite.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your class is just the foundation; your weapons define your build. With 13 weapon types and over 150 skills, your abilities physically change depending on what's in your hands. An off-hand sword grants a parry or riposte, a mace brings the stuns, and a shield lets you charge. Every weapon type has its own level 20 mastery track, meaning experimenting with new gear never feels like wasted time. Plus, the right gear can push your skills well past their normal level caps.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/c591f00c9cea65bfb6898b46834ac5c8.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/c591f00c9cea65bfb6898b46834ac5c8.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/c591f00c9cea65bfb6898b46834ac5c8.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/74d2e0266a96897f2552edf521ac247f.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBAT YOU HAVE TO READ, NOT SPAM<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stamina matters. Manage your dodging and sprinting or get caught out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Enemies telegraph attacks with a clear glint, and if you interrupt their swing, it doesn't land.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Break an enemy's guard to stagger them and open them up for massive damage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Builder\/spender economy: Earn your power before you blow it. Fully empowered heavy attacks devastate; swinging wild with no resources just glances off.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bosses have multiple phases and highly readable mechanics. Miss a ritual interrupt, and you just buffed the boss. Every mechanic matters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/5c456b8c5b47a1f9b0fc767265fd7b86.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/5c456b8c5b47a1f9b0fc767265fd7b86.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/5c456b8c5b47a1f9b0fc767265fd7b86.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Actual Gameplay footage, except for 'Cinematic' Camera angles)<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/699f29188a876bbe6634b39bdbef77db.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOOT THAT KEEPS YOU UP TOO LATE<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Six rarity tiers from Common to Mythic, complete with the mandatory, dopamine-inducing light beams when they drop. • Loot physically scatters and tumbles across the ground. Chests don't just open; they violently erupt with treasure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Upgrade weapons all the way to +20. They gain glowing visual effects every five levels: Frostbound, Radiant, Inferno, and Transcendent.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Slot runes, cut sockets, and reroll that one annoying affix you absolutely hate.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Diablo-style quick salvage so you can instantly turn junk inventory into upgrade mats.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Equip Sin Relics, condensed fragments of boss power that can completely alter how your build plays.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/d8d7f47369cbb927eb28953ee695a311.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/d8d7f47369cbb927eb28953ee695a311.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/d8d7f47369cbb927eb28953ee695a311.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRAFTING THAT ACTUALLY MATTERS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Master Blacksmithing, Tailoring, Refining, Cooking, and Potion Making.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Gather materials via Mining, Woodcutting, and Foraging (complete with a timing mini-game so you can harvest faster).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Build gear from scratch. The materials you choose dictate the stats, rarity, and appearance, and you get to preview the exact result before you spend a dime.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cook 16 different meals from up to four ingredients to stack long-lasting buffs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Experiment to find hidden properties in reagents and brew potions for healing, speed, warding, and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/1aac47f5bc70c5beedbf063ec92dcc79.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE ENDGAME: THE DESCENT<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Expeditions<\/strong>: Dive into procedurally generated dungeons across six districts. Pick a Dominion (Ashen Reach, Black Fortress, or Hollow Wilds), and fight your way to a Warden boss.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Covenant Trials:<\/strong> Co-op shrine runs mixing puzzles and combat. You will get three random puzzles (out of 15) leading up to a guardian fight. Entirely doable solo, but way more fun with a squad.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>The Last Vigil:<\/strong> A horde mode where you hold a fortress against six escalating, three-lane assaults. Bank your loot between waves, or push your luck for better rewards and risk losing it all.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/429358bc76dd4113a64af0a4d955961c.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/429358bc76dd4113a64af0a4d955961c.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/429358bc76dd4113a64af0a4d955961c.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/9f75976427ad5fabd3bea5f772437634.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BETTER TOGETHER<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Seamless drop-in and drop-out online co-op for 1 to 4 players via Steam.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Friends can jump in mid-run, and everyone gets their own instanced loot. No fighting over drops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Every boss, puzzle, and defense event scales beautifully. Solo is completely viable, but in a party, everyone has a real role to play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/9bf3a2fcb8f8617610ed33b59ae919bc.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/9bf3a2fcb8f8617610ed33b59ae919bc.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/9bf3a2fcb8f8617610ed33b59ae919bc.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/9285caa1af2bc887774334edd124ca95.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROFESSIONS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Gather Ores, flowers, and wood from around the world.<i> Mining makes you stronger (<\/i>+STR),<i> Gathering makes you smarter (<\/i>+INT).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Craft potions that give you meaningful buffs<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cook food that will make you stronger<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Forge your perfect Sword, or Chest Piece by using materials that provide the stats you need.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/1bd7520e9311b68fc7f33c0e259066c4.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/1bd7520e9311b68fc7f33c0e259066c4.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/1bd7520e9311b68fc7f33c0e259066c4.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAKE IT YOURS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Craft Armor, and Weapons Exactly the way you want them to be.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A deep, modular character creator to dial in your exact look.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A fully-featured Wardrobe system: once you loot a piece of gear, you unlock its look permanently.. Transmog away.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 47 dye palettes to color-coordinate your armor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Five character slots, a shared account stash, and Steam Cloud saves to keep your progress safe.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/3f4b7c62602f93163aeeb38ccb5d5254.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/3f4b7c62602f93163aeeb38ccb5d5254.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/3f4b7c62602f93163aeeb38ccb5d5254.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/52e4a2b54dfdad0dd78f96121f756f3c.avif?t=1793658805\" width=1170 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Seven Sins are only the mouths. Something beneath the world has finally opened its eye.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Sin Hunts:<\/strong> Track down the Seven Sins and the Grave Regent as repeatable, super-charged bosses to farm their unique relics. (Mythics)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Push your limits with four difficulties (up to Abyssal) and toggleable Oaths that crank up both the danger and the drop rates.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Sera's Ledger:<\/strong> A bounty board of wanted posters and contracts rewarding you for clearing every activity on every difficulty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/988f21bff7b6fe0836be829a6f96b7b1.poster.avif?t=1793658805\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/988f21bff7b6fe0836be829a6f96b7b1.webm?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/extras\/988f21bff7b6fe0836be829a6f96b7b1.mp4?t=1793658805\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Abandon all hope.&quot;<\/p>","short_description":"Abandon All Hope is a 1 to 4 player dark fantasy action RPG. Hunt the Seven Sins across a shattering world, master tactical combat, and craft absurdly powerful gear. Mix Weapons with different classes, play your way combat. 5+ Ways to earn loot after the campaign. Can you survive the decent?","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/c29569ae4e4c5ef443606cb7dfd88c749b6f69b2\/header.jpg?t=1793658805","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/d6852203199ea5612243f24591368aead8283c90\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793658805","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/d6852203199ea5612243f24591368aead8283c90\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793658805","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i3 \/ Ryzen 3<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> 3GB<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 3 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> n\/a<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> n\/a<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Hosting may use more RAM<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i5 \/ Ryzen 5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> 6GB<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 3 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> n\/a<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> n\/a<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Hosting may use more RAM<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["DeadLink"],"publishers":["DeadLink"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":969,"final":775,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"9,69€","final_formatted":"7,75€"},"packages":[1763906],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Abandon All Hope","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1763906,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Abandon All Hope - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">9,69€<\/span> 7,75€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":775}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":75,"description":"Keyboard Only Option"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5091010\/7b355f5788d8729dec6b05133850e73d5a52608b\/ss_7b355f5788d8729dec6b0